          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/amanda.jpg",
            "title": "Amanda Foxwell",
            "role": "Mental Health Counselor",
            "content": "<p>Amanda Foxwell is a mental health counselor who works with teens and adults navigating trauma, anxiety, and related emotional concerns. She holds a master’s degree in Mental Health Counseling from Capella University and a bachelor’s degree in Applied Behavior Analysis from Purdue University. Amanda is currently working toward licensure as a Licensed Professional Counselor of Mental Health.</p><p>Amanda is EMDR-trained and certified in ecotherapy, reflecting her holistic and nature-informed approach to healing. She brings warmth, empathy, and evidence-based care to her work, creating a supportive therapeutic environment where clients can process challenges, build resilience, and move toward meaningful growth.</p>",
